#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:43
msgid ""
"Don’t want to sequence the names break yourself? Marquee makes it from your "
"xLights layout: your screens stay dark for the names, the rest of your house"
" plays gentle effects, and every prop flashes as each name goes up. It can "
"also make themed versions for kids to pick from (Candy Cane Swirl, "
"Snowfall…). You open them in xLights, render, and upload, like any sequence."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:47
msgid "Your xLights layout"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:48
msgid ""
"The file xlights_rgbeffects.xml in your xLights show folder. It stays on "
"your computer: Marquee reads it right here in your browser."
