msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:56
msgid "Your names break sequence (if you have one)"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:57
msgid ""
"Optional. Give it your own names break (.xsq) and the themed versions are "
"made from it: same music, same timing, same singing faces, just new colors "
"and effects. Leave it empty and Marquee makes everything from scratch."
msgstr ""

