msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:77
msgid ""
"How the AI helps: Marquee reads your layout (step 1) here in your browser "
"and tells the AI only your prop names and what kind each is (trees, arches, "
"rooflines…). The AI picks the colors and an effect for each kind; Marquee "
"then writes the sequence from your layout. Your layout file itself never "
"leaves your computer."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:77
msgid ""
"Describing your own theme uses the AI under “Need help?” (add a ChatGPT or "
"Claude key there). The ready-made themes don’t need it."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:80
msgid "You don’t need to set up any timing."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:80
msgid ""
"Marquee makes sure each kid’s name shows up at the right moment: right after"
" the announcer’s intro, then a new name every few seconds, so the names "
"always line up with the music. It works this out for you, and “Use it” fills"
" in the numbers. There’s nothing to measure in xLights."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:81
msgid "Make my sequences"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:86
msgid "Then: render them in xLights (FPP can only play rendered sequences)"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:88
msgid ""
"Save the .xsq files into your xLights show folder (the folder with "
"xlights_rgbeffects.xml in it)."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:91
msgid ""
"Open one in xLights. If it asks for the music, pick %s (download it below "
"and put it in your show folder)."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:93
msgid ""
"Click Render All, play it in the house preview, change anything you like, "
"then Save. Saving writes the .fseq file next to it: that’s what FPP plays."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:94
msgid ""
"Send them to your FPP, either way: in xLights, Tools → FPP Connect, tick "
"your FPP and the new sequences, and click Upload (it sends the .fseq and the"
" music together); or in FPP → Content Setup → File Manager, upload the .fseq"
" (Sequences tab) and the music (Audio tab)."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:95
msgid ""
"In FPP → Content Setup → Playlists, make a playlist for each one with just "
"that sequence and its music: “%s” for your names break, “Names - Candy Cane "
"Swirl” and so on for the themes. Don’t add them to your show schedule; "
"Marquee plays them between songs."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/seqmaker.php:96
msgid ""
"Themes: click “Use it” next to each one below so kids can pick it, then Save"
" settings. The setup check at the top of Names in Lights tells you if FPP "
"can’t find a playlist."
msgstr ""

