#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:258
msgid ""
"📋 <b>You’ll see three playlists on your FPP: “%1$s”, “%1$s 2” and “%1$s 1”. "
"Keep all three.</b> They aren’t copies by mistake: they play the same light "
"sequence with the full, 2-name and 1-name sound, and your FPP picks the "
"right one for how many names are waiting. If you delete one, Marquee makes "
"it again the next time you build."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:262
msgid ""
"You’ll get three versions to listen to right here. They start the same on "
"purpose: the names aren’t in the files, because your FPP says each name live"
" over the soft music as it goes up. The versions only differ in length: the "
"full break (3 to 6 names waiting), a shorter one for 2 names and the "
"shortest for 1 name (each said twice), so nobody waits through 30 seconds of"
" music for one name. Your FPP picks the right one by itself. Happy with it? "
"You’re done: within a minute your FPP downloads it and sets up the playlists"
" by itself. Not happy? Change a line or the music and build again. Each "
"build uses about 100 ElevenLabs credits."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:265 plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:193
msgid "Questions"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:266
msgid "Why do the full, 2-name and 1-name versions sound the same?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:266
msgid ""
"Because the names aren’t in them: your FPP plays each kid’s name live, in "
"its own sound slot, over the soft music. The three versions are the same "
"intro, music and outro, just with a shorter soft part for fewer names, so "
"the outro comes sooner. Listen to the end of each and you’ll hear the "
"difference."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:267
msgid "Do I have to change my xLights sequence?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:267
msgid ""
"No. Only the sound changes. Marquee times the names to fit your sequence’s "
"length."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:268
msgid "I already made my own break audio. Do I need this?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:268
msgid ""
"No. Nothing changes on your FPP until you click Build. Just make sure your "
"audio has a quiet part for the names, and set “When the first name appears” "
"and “Time between names” in Connect your FPP to match it."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:269
msgid "What exactly changes on my FPP?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:269
msgid ""
"Three sound files are added (marquee-break-full.wav, -2 and -1). Your “%1$s”"
" playlist is set to play the full one with your names sequence, and two "
"playlists are added for the short breaks: “%1$s 2” and “%1$s 1”. Keep all "
"three playlists. A copy of your original playlist is kept on the FPP."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:270
msgid "Can I use Santa?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/break.php:270
msgid ""
