#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:119
msgid "Kids’ pictures on your screens"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:119
msgid ""
"Kids can add a picture of themselves (or a cartoon of it) to their name. You"
" approve every picture before it goes up."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:120 plugin/marquee/inc/social.php:677
#: plugin/marquee/inc/support.php:370
msgid "On"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:125
msgid "Please read before turning this on"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:127
msgid ""
"These are pictures of children, shown in public at your show. You are "
"responsible for what goes up on your screens and for following the laws "
"where you live."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:128
msgid ""
"In the United States, collecting a picture from a child under 13 online is "
"covered by COPPA, which requires a parent’s permission. Marquee asks a "
"parent or guardian to tick a box before any picture is sent, but it can’t "
"check who ticked it. Other countries have their own rules (in Europe, the "
"GDPR)."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:129
msgid ""
"Every picture waits for you or a Show helper to approve it in Show Control "
"or the Show Manager, unless you turn on the automatic check below: then only"
" the pictures it isn’t sure about wait for you. A name whose picture isn’t "
"approved within 10 minutes goes up without the picture."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:130
msgid ""
"The phone shrinks the picture to a small square before sending it. Marquee "
"keeps it in a private folder (never in your Media Library, never on a page) "
"and deletes it as soon as it’s been shown, removed or turned down, and "
"always within 2 hours."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:131
msgid ""
"The cartoon version is made on the kid’s own phone: they frame their face, "
"pick Cartoon Me, an elf, a snowman or one of Santa’s helpers, and see how it"
" will look on your screen. Only the finished picture is sent, never the "
"photo. It’s the safer choice and looks better on pixel screens."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:132
msgid ""
"To cut the kid out of the background, the phone downloads a free tool "
"(Google’s MediaPipe) from the jsDelivr code library the first time. Only the"
" tool is downloaded; the picture stays on the phone. If it can’t load, a "
"soft oval around the face is used instead."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:133
msgid ""
"Pictures need FPP 10 or newer on the FPP that runs each screen, and the "
"Marquee names script 3.14 or newer. On a small pixel matrix a face is only a"
" few dozen pixels tall; it looks best on a TV or projector."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:135
msgid ""
"This isn’t legal advice. If you’re unsure, ask someone who knows the rules "
"where you live, or leave this off."
msgstr ""

