msgid ""
"Your FPP is version %s. Pictures need FPP 10 or newer; names still go up "
"without them."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:162
msgid ""
"Names go up during songs (Names in Lights, How names go up), so they aren’t "
"spoken: the voice would talk over your music. The picture shows first, then "
"the name. Pick “Between songs: a names break” to have names said out loud."
msgstr ""

