msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:173
msgid "Check pictures automatically"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/photos.php:173
msgid ""
"Google Cloud Vision looks at each picture first. One that’s clean, shows "
"exactly one face and has no words in it goes up without waiting for you. "
"Anything else still waits for you in Show Control, with the reason. You can "
"still remove any name and its picture at any time."
msgstr ""

