#: plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:194
msgid "How do I make a themed sequence?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:194
msgid ""
"Copy your names break sequence in xLights and change the effects on your "
"house to fit the theme (red and white swirls for Candy Cane, white twinkles "
"for Snowfall…). Keep your screens dark where the names go: FPP draws the "
"names on top. Give it soft music with no singing so the spoken names can be "
"heard. Upload it to FPP and put it in its own playlist, named like the "
"examples."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:195
msgid "What are “First name appears at” and “Time between names”?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:195
msgid ""
"While the themed sequence plays, the first name shows up this many seconds "
"in, then a new one every “time between names” seconds, up to 6. The little "
"timeline under each theme shows exactly where they land. If the theme was "
"made by the Sequence maker from your names break, use the same numbers as "
"your names break (“Use it” fills them in)."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:196
msgid "What if a playlist is missing on my FPP?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:196
msgid ""
"Names for that theme go up in your Classic break instead, and the setup "
"check on this page tells you which playlist it couldn’t find."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:197
msgid "Do I need pictures?"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/themes.php:197
msgid ""
"No. Without one, kids see a little animated picture of a lit-up house in "
"that theme’s colors (pick the look under each theme). A photo or short clip "
"of your own house during that sequence is even better."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/marquee/inc/updates.php:173
msgid ""
"Couldn’t check GitHub for Marquee updates (%1$s ago): %2$s. It tries again "
"every 15 minutes, or click “Check again”."
